msgid "Creating a Build Environment Shell"
msgstr ""

#: src/advanced-build.md:447
msgid ""
"If you are working on specific components of the system, and will be using "
"some of the tools in the `redox` directory and bypassing `make`, you may "
"wish to create a build environment shell. This shell includes the `prefix` "
"tools in your `PATH`. You can do this with:"
msgstr ""

