msgid ""
"This command also works with a Podman Build, creating a shell in Podman and "
"setting `PATH` to include the necessary build tools."
msgstr ""

#: src/advanced-build.md:455
msgid "Updating The Sources"
msgstr ""

#: src/advanced-build.md:457
msgid ""
"If you want to update the build system or if some of the recipes have "
"changed, you can update those parts of the system with `make pull`. However, "
"this will not update the sources of the recipes."
msgstr ""

#: src/advanced-build.md:467
msgid ""
"If you want to update the source for the recipes, use `make rebuild`, or "
"remove the file `$(BUILD)/fetch.tag` and run `make fetch`"
msgstr ""

